Ghaibat Se Chale Aao Ansaar Bulate Hain<br>
<br>
mazloom Ke Bekas Keghamkhar Bulate Hain<br>
<br>
1.ankhou'n Me Chamakti Yeh Ummeed Ki Shabnam Hai<br>
aur Aapki Furqat Ka Har Qalb Me Matam Hai<br>
palkou'n Pe Ruke Aansu Sarkaar Bulate Hain<br>
<br>
2. Gham Karb-0-bala Ka Hai Seenou'n Me Abhi Taaza<br>
badla Hai Abhi Baaqi Khoone Shah-e-bekas Ka<br>
tum Ko Yeh Aza Khane Har Baar Bulate Hain<br>
<br>
<br>
3.jo Haal Diloun Ka Hai Ham Kisse Kahe'n Moula<br>
batlao Kahan Jakar Faryaad Kare Moula<br>
jo Aapke Shia Hain Khuddaar Bulate Hain<br>
<br>
<br>
4.bheja Tha Kabhi Sheh Ne Shiyou'n Ko Salaam Apna<br>
hum Yaad Usay Karke Rote Hain Bohat Moula<br>
ehsaas Ka Hum Karke Izhaar Bulate Hain<br>
<br>
5. Pur Zulm-o-sitam Se Ab Duniya Yeh Huvi Moula<br>
mazloomou'n Kaab Koi Hamdard Nahi Aaqa<br>
yeh Aapki Aamad Ke Aasaar Bulate Hain<br>
<br>
6. Hai Dhoop Me Zehra Ki Turbat Pe Nahi Saaya<br>
tameer-e-baqi Ka Phir Rakhna Hai Tumhe Paaya<br>
hum Log Tumhe Haq Me Memaar Bulate Hain<br>
<br>
7.us Jung Se Ab Thande Yeh Qalb-o-jigar Honge<br>
aye Muntaqim-e-karbal Tum Aao Toh Sar Honge<br>
jo Mareka-e-haq Hai Dushwar Bulate Hain<br>
<br>
8.kyun Khoon Ke Aansu Tum Tanhayi Me Rote Ho<br>
ab Izn-e-khuda Lekar Maidaan Me Aajao<br>
gham Karb-0-bala Ke Phir Ek Baar Bulate Hain<br>
<br>
9.jo Aapke Aane Ki Sharte'n Thi Huvi Poori<br>
moula Hame Batlado Phir Kisliye Yeh Doori<br>
jo Jazba-e-sadeq Hai Me'aar Bulate Hain